// Package dictionary: disabled-child education allowance (AEEH, wave 3 +
// finish wave R541-1..10).
// The rules of `02-droit-montant.law` derive the computation-level right,
// the base amount, the six category supplements and the isolated-parent
// supplement (MPI) from the pinned fragments; the case supplies the BMAF,
// the commission-established TrafficCategory and reason facts, the MTP
// amount and the isolation facts (provenance — case facts).
// Modules 05..10 carry the R. 541-1..10 regulatory mechanics: incapacity
// thresholds, category criteria, demande procedure, durations, revision,
// control, silence, effect dates, hospitalization, PCH interplay and the
// death extension (see the per-article map below). Module 11-dom-aeeh
// carries the DOM transfer (D-73): AEEH attribution in the L. 751-1
// collectivities (L. 755-20) and the DOM/metropolitan amount identity
// (D. 755-11), both as institutional norms without new positions.
//
// DEONTIC MAP OVER PINNED TEXTS ONLY (bytes of 01-sources.law; outside
// them — boundary, not conjecture).
//
//   D1. Duty of the fund to pay. «a droit à une allocation» (L. 541-1,
//   para. 1) + «est attribuée et versée» linkage via the computed total.
//   The duty triggers on aeeh_montant_total (right + computed amount).
//   The debtor fund unnamed in the texts — the «debtor fund of the case»
//   link is empirical (deontic-migration.md pattern), performance is the
//   empirical fact aeeh_versee. Window [@2021-01-01, ∞) is the package
//   coverage window. The CNSA principal (L. 541-5: bodies serve and
//   control for the CNSA against reimbursement) names the same empirical
//   bearer; no separate rule.
//   D2. Suspension power (L. 541-2, para. 2): «l'allocation peut être
//   suspendue ou supprimée» when the carer does not follow the measures
//   recommended by the commission, after a hearing at the person's
//   request. Modelled as a power (03-pouvoir-suspension.law): holder the
//   debtor body, exercise suspension_prononcee, effect the removal of the
//   computed total. Window [@2021-01-01, ∞).
//   No recipient duties («doit», «est tenu») in the L/D scope; no sanctions
//   or recovery procedures in scope: cross recovery under L. 553-2 is package
//   fr.prestations.versement (wave 5).
//   L. 541-3 (L. 521-2 applicable): the designation/sharing mechanism is
//   owned by fr.pf.af (wave-1 lane); the carer link arrives per case as
//   fr.pf.core::parent_charge (B-AEEH-PARTAGE).
//
//   R. 541-1 (05-seuils-taux, 10-deces-prolongation): 80 %/50 % thresholds,
//   50-80 % tranche, prise-en-charge definition and the annual single
//   payment modality are institutional computation, no new positions
//   (payment stays D1); the death prolongation end date is institutional
//   computation shared with R. 541-4 V, while the branch amounts («ce
//   versement») conclude only for L. 541-1 para. 4 leave/suspension
//   periods (periodes_conges_internat).
//   R. 541-2 (06-categories): the six-category criteria are an institutional
//   verification skeleton (categorieN_criteres_remplis); the commission
//   classification itself stays the established categorie_attribuee fact
//   (B-PFAEEH-CATEGORIE kept for the act of classifying).
//   R. 541-3 (07-procedure-demande): demande completeness is institutional
//   (certificate + both declaration branches + dossier useful-pieces fact
//   bound to the filing date, PIECES CONTRACT; the usefulness/completeness
//   determination arrives as an adjudicated dossier fact, decision-maker
//   unspecified in source — B-PFAEEH-PIECES-APPRECIATION); duties
//   JoindrePiecesDemande (bearer: carer) and TransmettreDossierMDPH
//   (bearer: MDPH, «transmet, sans délai» — no computable deadline).
//   R. 541-4 (08-durees-revision, 10-deces-prolongation): duration bounds
//   and exclusive due-ends are institutional computation under an explicit
//   award regime (REGIME CONTRACT: the «Par dérogation» special period
//   displaces the ordinary 1°/2° for the same award; the ordinary head
//   additionally requires an affirmative record that at least one trigger
//   is absent — certificat_sans_perspective or equipe_sans_proposition);
//   the 2026 50-80 % special bounds and due-ends additionally require the
//   initial/renewal filing cohort (demande_attribution_aeeh_deposee from
//   2026-04-01, decree 2026-227 NOTA), older filings keeping the
//   unconditional 2-5 year period (no regime, no prospect); liberties
//   DemanderRevisionBeneficiaire/Organisme and ControlerEffectivite
//   (organisme); duties SaisirCommission, VerserAvanceComplement (organisme),
//   StatuerUrgence and ReexaminerAggravation (commission); the
//   change-of-body persistence feeds aeeh_droit_calcule directly.
//   R. 541-5 (08-durees-revision): reexamination deadline + retard are
//   institutional computation; duty ReexaminerMesures (commission).
//   R. 541-6 (09-dates-effet): silence deadline + rejet_implicite are
//   institutional computation (legal fiction, no position).
//   R. 541-7 (09-dates-effet): start/end dates are institutional
//   computation; the R. 512-2 link is an institutional bridge reading pub
//   fr.pf.core::enfant_ouvre_droit; PCH end is institutional computation;
//   duties SuspendreComplement and RetablirComplement (organisme).
//   R. 541-8 (09-dates-effet): assimilation date is institutional
//   computation; assimilation is defeasible with a contraintes defeater;
//   liberty MaintenirVersementHospitalisation (commission).
//   R. 541-9 (07-procedure-demande): duty DeposerDemandePCH (carer),
//   gated on a pursued third-element request (filing channel, not a
//   universal filing duty).
//   R. 541-10 (07-procedure-demande): charge exclusion is institutional
//   (simultaneous AEEH + third-element PCH requests); duties
//   ReviserDecision (al. 2, supplement awarded for non-tierce expenses)
//   and ReexaminerComplement (al. 3, L. 245-1 III 1° beneficiary +
//   handicap/factor evolution); prohibition OpterComplementAvantEcheance
//   (al. 3, carer, L. 245-3 2°/4°/5° lump-sum elements, action named
//   positively).
//   L. 755-20 (11-dom-aeeh): «est attribuée dans les collectivités
//   mentionnées à l'article L. 751-1» is an institutional attribution
//   status (entitled child resident in a listed collectivity); no duty
//   (no bearer, no «doit»: payment stays D1 on the computed total).
//   «dans des conditions fixées par décret» is a decree delegation:
//   D. 755-11 is pinned as the operative decree provision for the
//   amounts (B-PFAEEH-DOM-DECRET-CONDITIONS).
//   D. 755-11 (11-dom-aeeh): «est identique à celui qui est applicable
//   en métropole» is institutional computation: the DOM amount is built
//   from the computed metropolitan total and a presented DOM amount is
//   checked against the built value (DECISION-0452). No duty,
//   prohibition, power or liberty: an equality statement names no act
//   and no actor.
//
// LAYER BOUNDARIES (omission records, not norms):
// B-PFAEEH-TETE: the computation-level head is carried by this package on
// its own decision fact. fr.pf.core holds parallel principle-level filters
// (AeehDecisionCdaph, AeehExclusionInternat) that are package-internal (§24,
// not exported): this package cannot read them, so it does not; case worlds
// assert the local symbol and the upstream filters stay silent there. Same
// source facts, no redefinition.
// B-PFAEEH-INTERNAT: the L. 541-1 para. 4 exclusion («n'est pas due lorsque
// ... sauf pour les périodes de congés ou de suspension») is period-scoped
// and needs period facts this package has not (no month-of-right index):
// not modelled here. The upstream principle-level defeater covers it in
// 2021+ worlds; full-cover internat cases outside leave are out of scope
// for the computation.
// B-PFAEEH-BMAF-EURO: BMAF series (L. 551-1) — neighbour fr.pf.core; in the
// case — bmaf_retenue fact.
// B-PFAEEH-SEUIL: RETIRED by the finish wave — the 80 %/50 % thresholds are
// pinned parameters (SeuilIncapacite80/50) read by 05-seuils-taux rules.
// B-PFAEEH-CATEGORIE: the commission act of classifying and the evaluation
// guide (R. 541-2 chapeau, arrêté-defined) arrive as the established
// categorie_attribuee fact (CDAPH channel, as APL R. 822-13); the article's
// verifiable criteria skeleton is executable in 06-categories.
// B-PFAEEH-MTP: sixth-category complement equals the MTP amount (L. 341-4,
// external, unpinned) — montant_mtp_retenu fact.
// B-PFAEEH-PARTAGE: designation and sharing per L. 521-2 via L. 541-3 —
// mechanism owned by fr.pf.af; carer link per case.
// B-PFAEEH-DUREE: RETIRED by the finish wave — attribution periods,
// revision, silence-is-rejection, AAH succession and the death extension
// are modelled in 08/09/10 (R. 541-4..7 + R. 541-1 al. 5).
// B-PFAEEH-PCH: PCH (CASF L. 245-1, external) — percoit_pch fact; the PCH
// mechanics themselves (L. 245-1/R. 245-36) stay external
// (B-PFAEEH-PCH-MECANIQUE): only the AEEH-side effects are modelled.
// B-PFAEEH-ARRONDI: no cent-rounding rule in scope; Money keeps exact
// Decimal products (observed: 395.04 x 0.32 = 126.4128 TRUE), no silent
// rounding to cents. Payable cents are a fund-side step outside scope.
// B-PFAEEH-GUIDE-BAREME: the incapacity guide-barème and its decrees
// (93-1216, 2004-1136, 77-1549, R. 541-1 al. 2) are external; the fixed
// rate arrives as taux_incapacite_retenu.
// B-PFAEEH-SEUILS-ARRETE: each R. 541-2 category expense amount («montant
// fixé par arrêté») is unpinned — seuil_depenses_retenu inputs.
// B-PFAEEH-GUIDE-EVALUATION: the R. 541-2 evaluation guide (arrêté) is
// unpinned; only the article's stated criteria are executable.
// B-PFAEEH-TEMPS-PLEIN: the legal working duration (R. 541-2 last alinea,
// Code du travail, external) is unpinned; full-time gates arrive as
// established facts.
// B-PFAEEH-MODELE-ARRETE: the R. 541-3 declaration model (joint arrêtés)
// is unpinned; declaration contents arrive as case facts.
// B-PFAEEH-PIECES-APPRECIATION: R. 541-3 al. 2 requires «toutes les pièces
// justificatives utiles à l'appréciation des droits» but names no
// decision-maker for the usefulness/completeness determination; the MDPH
// is the recipient, not the appointed evaluator. The dossier fact arrives
// as an adjudicated record; who established it is case provenance, not a
// source delegation.
// B-PFAEEH-DELAI-URGENCE: the urgent-decision deadline (R. 541-4 IV,
// joint arrêté) is unpinned; the duty to decide urgently has no
// computable date.
// B-PFAEEH-PCH-MECANIQUE: CASF L. 245-1/R. 245-36 (PCH elements,
// attribution) are external; PCH-side dates arrive as case facts.
// B-PFAEEH-DOM-L751-1: the L. 751-1 collectivity list is not pinned in
// this package; the Territoire values spell the six collectivities of
// the Title V header in force over the program window (Guadeloupe,
// Guyane, Martinique, Réunion, Saint-Barthélemy, Saint-Martin;
// Mayotte joins only 2028-01-01, outside the window). Residence
// arrives as the residence_enfant case fact.
// B-PFAEEH-DOM-DECRET-CONDITIONS: L. 755-20 awards «dans des conditions
// fixées par décret»; D. 755-11 (amount identity with metropolitan
// France) is the pinned operative decree provision. No other decree-set
// DOM award conditions are identified in the pinned corpus; the
// metropolitan award mechanics of this package (CDAPH decision,
// thresholds, categories) apply unmodified.
//

// INPUT CONTRACT (engine has no absence test): exactly one of
// {categorie_attribuee, sans_complement} and exactly one of
// {mpi-triggering facts, sans_mpi} per entitled child; cases probing
// silence assert exactly one of {decision_cdaph_favorable,
// sans_decision_cdaph}; cases probing reexamination assert exactly one of
// {reexamen_effectue, sans_reexamen}. The retained BMAF is
// keyed by child (not by household): the computation heads are per-child
// (D. 541-1 «pour chaque enfant») and every keyed premise must arrive with
// its key bound — free-key generation does not run outside the latest
// edition, so per-child keying keeps the 2012 cases computable.
// Percent and hour facts are Decimal points («80» means 80 %, «8» means
// eight hours), matching the Decimal threshold parameters.
// PCH SUBTYPE CONTRACT (R. 541-9/10): demande_troisieme_element_pch is
// asserted only when a PCH third-element request (housing/vehicle/
// transport charges) is pursued for the child; complement_depenses_
// non_tierce only when the awarded supplement covers expenses other than
// third-person recourse; beneficiaire_pch_l2451_iii_1 only for PCH
// beneficiaries under L. 245-1 III 1° CASF; evolution_handicap_charges
// only on handicap evolution or changed charge-determining factors;
// elements_pch_versement_ponctuel only for L. 245-3 2°/4°/5° elements
// with a lump-sum payment. Neighbouring-subtype requests never stand in
// for these facts; missing subtype facts stay silent (open world).
// COHORT CONTRACT (R. 541-4, decree 2026-227 NOTA): the 2026 50-80 %
// special bounds and due-ends apply only to initial/renewal AEEH requests
// filed from 2026-04-01 — demande_attribution_aeeh_deposee carries that
// filing date; without it no 2026 50-80 % head concludes (pending, not
// false), and pre-2026 filings keep the 2-5 year award period.
// REGIME CONTRACT (R. 541-4 I, «Par dérogation aux dispositions des
// deuxième et troisième alinéas»): the special period and the ordinary
// due-ends cannot conclude for the same award. Cases assert exactly one
// of {attribution_derogation_r5414, attribution_ordinaire_r5414} per
// award, both as adjudicated commission-record facts; the derogation head
// additionally requires the prospect + proposal facts, the ordinary head
// the AAH/conditions trigger PLUS an affirmative record that at least one
// trigger is absent ({certificat_sans_perspective, equipe_sans_proposition},
// separate ordinary cases per basis). A missing regime or a missing
// absence record stays silent on the ordinary head (pending, not false);
// absence is never inferred from a missing trigger fact. The pre-2026
// 50-80 % unconditional period needs no regime fact (R. 541-4 II,
// 2019/2022 wordings).
// PIECES CONTRACT (R. 541-3 al. 2, «toutes les pièces justificatives
// utiles»): demande_complete requires the filing (demande_aeeh_deposee),
// the certificate, both declaration branches AND the dossier
// pieces_utiles_completes(e, depot) fact bound to that filing date. The
// dossier fact arrives as an adjudicated record (origin adjudicated);
// the certificate plus declarations alone never conclude completeness; a
// missing dossier fact stays silent (pending, not false). The source does
// not appoint the usefulness evaluator (B-PFAEEH-PIECES-APPRECIATION).
// REJET CONTRACT (R. 541-6): date_rejet_implicite is the exclusive
// +4-month threshold (filing + 4 calendar months); the fiction holds
// strictly beyond it («plus de quatre mois»), never on it.
//
// Scenarios: tests/aeeh-*.lawtest (families fr.pf.aeeh#droit-montant /
// #pouvoir-suspension / #devoir-versement in law.toml): inputs→value;
// boundary pairs (category edges, MPI reasons, isolation); OpenFisca AEEH 3
// (family #openfisca-import); positions: ACTIVE / power exercisable.
// tests/r541-*.lawtest (families #seuils-taux, #categories,
// #procedure-demande, #durees-revision, #dates-effet, #deces-prolongation):
// threshold/date pairs, duration bounds, positions ACTIVE + silent pairs,
// edition pairs across 2022-01-31.
// tests/dom-*.lawtest (family #dom-aeeh): six-collectivity attribution +
// metropole/autre silence, amount build-first, presented-vs-built check
// pair, 2021-edition proof. No new positions (institutional norms only).

language "law.core" version "0.2";
package fr.pf.aeeh version "0.1.0";
namespace "urn:fr:corpus:clir:pf-aeeh";

import fr.pf.core version "0.1.0";

pub enum CategorieComplement {
    label fr official "catégorie du complément d'allocation, fixée par la commission (D. 541-2, fait établi)";
    label en unofficial "supplement category set by the commission (D. 541-2, established fact)";
    CATEGORIE_1,
    CATEGORIE_2,
    CATEGORIE_3,
    CATEGORIE_4,
    CATEGORIE_5,
    CATEGORIE_6
}

pub relation bmaf_retenue(e: fr.pf.core::Enfant, montant: Money) kind empirical {
    key(e);
    label fr official "base mensuelle L. 551-1 retenue pour le mois du droit de l'enfant (arrêté, montant non épinglé)";
    label en unofficial "L. 551-1 monthly base retained for the child's month of right (arrete figure, unpinned)";
}

pub relation categorie_attribuee(e: fr.pf.core::Enfant, cat: CategorieComplement) kind empirical {
    key(e);
    label fr official "classement de l'enfant par la commission dans l'une des six catégories (R. 541-2 — hors champ, fait établi)";
    label en unofficial "commission classification of the child into one of the six categories (R. 541-2 - out of scope, established fact)";
}

pub relation sans_complement(e: fr.pf.core::Enfant) kind empirical {
    label fr official "aucun complément attribué pour l'enfant (seule l'allocation proprement dite est due)";
    label en unofficial "no supplement awarded for the child (only the base allowance is due)";
}

pub relation complement_contrainte_activite(e: fr.pf.core::Enfant) kind empirical {
    label fr official "la commission a accordé un complément car l'état de l'enfant contraint à renoncer, cesser ou réduire l'activité ou exige une tierce personne rémunérée (D. 541-3)";
    label en unofficial "the commission granted a supplement because the condition forces giving up, stopping or reducing work or requires a paid third person (D. 541-3)";
}

pub relation personne_isolee(p: fr.pf.core::Personne) kind empirical {
    label fr official "personne isolée assumant seule la charge de l'enfant handicapé (L. 541-4)";
    label en unofficial "isolated person solely in charge of the disabled child (L. 541-4)";
}

pub relation percoit_pch(p: fr.pf.core::Personne) kind empirical {
    label fr official "bénéficie de la prestation de compensation L. 245-1 CASF (hors champ, fait du dossier)";
    label en unofficial "receives the L. 245-1 CASF compensation benefit (out of scope, case fact)";
}

pub relation montant_mtp_retenu(e: fr.pf.core::Enfant, montant: Money) kind empirical {
    key(e);
    label fr official "montant de la majoration pour tierce personne des invalides de 3e catégorie, retenu pour le complément de sixième catégorie (L. 341-4 — hors champ)";
    label en unofficial "third-category-invalidity third-person supplement retained for the sixth-category supplement (L. 341-4 - out of scope)";
}

pub relation sans_mpi(e: fr.pf.core::Enfant) kind empirical {
    label fr official "aucune majoration parent isolé pour l'enfant (conditions L. 541-4/D. 541-3 non réunies)";
    label en unofficial "no isolated-parent supplement for the child (L. 541-4/D. 541-3 conditions unmet)";
}

pub relation decision_cdaph_favorable(e: fr.pf.core::Enfant) kind empirical {
    label fr official "décision de la commission L. 146-9 CASF appréciant que l'état justifie l'attribution (L. 541-2, fait établi — adjudicated)";
    label en unofficial "L. 146-9 CASF commission decision that the condition warrants award (L. 541-2, established fact)";
}

pub relation non_suite_mesures(e: fr.pf.core::Enfant) kind empirical {
    label fr official "la personne ayant la charge ne donne pas suite aux mesures préconisées par la commission (L. 541-2 al. 2)";
    label en unofficial "the carer does not follow the measures recommended by the commission (L. 541-2 para. 2)";
}

pub relation audition_tenue(p: fr.pf.core::Personne) kind empirical {
    label fr official "audition de la personne à sa demande avant suspension ou suppression (L. 541-2 al. 2)";
    label en unofficial "hearing of the person at their request before suspension or removal (L. 541-2 para. 2)";
}

pub relation suspension_prononcee(e: fr.pf.core::Enfant) kind empirical {
    key(e);
    label fr official "action: suspension ou suppression de l'allocation prononcée par l'organisme";
    label en unofficial "action: suspension or removal of the allowance ordered by the body";
}

pub relation aeeh_versee(p: fr.pf.core::Personne, e: fr.pf.core::Enfant, montant: Money) kind empirical {
    key(p, e);
    label fr official "versement constaté de l'allocation au bénéficiaire (exécution; l'organisme figure au porteur)";
    label en unofficial "recorded payment of the allowance to the payee";
}

pub relation aeeh_droit_calcule(e: fr.pf.core::Enfant) kind institutional {
    key(e);
    label fr official "droit à l'AEEH au niveau calcul (décision CDAPH L. 541-2, taux décret — hors champ)";
    label en unofficial "AEEH entitlement at computation level (CDAPH decision L. 541-2, rate by decree - out of scope)";
}

pub relation aeeh_montant_base(e: fr.pf.core::Enfant, montant: Money) kind institutional {
    key(e);
    label fr official "montant mensuel de l'allocation proprement dite, 32 p. 100 de la base (D. 541-1)";
    label en unofficial "monthly base allowance, 32% of the base (D. 541-1)";
}

pub relation aeeh_montant_complement(e: fr.pf.core::Enfant, montant: Money) kind institutional {
    key(e);
    label fr official "montant mensuel du complément par catégorie, sixième = MTP (D. 541-2)";
    label en unofficial "monthly category supplement, sixth = MTP amount (D. 541-2)";
}

pub relation mpi_eligible(e: fr.pf.core::Enfant) kind institutional {
    key(e);
    label fr official "majoration parent isolé attribuable (L. 541-4, D. 541-3)";
    label en unofficial "isolated-parent supplement awardable (L. 541-4, D. 541-3)";
}

pub relation aeeh_montant_mpi(e: fr.pf.core::Enfant, montant: Money) kind institutional {
    key(e);
    label fr official "montant mensuel de la majoration parent isolé par catégorie (D. 541-4)";
    label en unofficial "monthly isolated-parent supplement by category (D. 541-4)";
}

pub relation aeeh_montant_total(e: fr.pf.core::Enfant, montant: Money) kind institutional {
    key(e);
    label fr official "total mensuel dû: base + complément + MPI (zéros portés)";
    label en unofficial "monthly total due: base + supplement + MPI (zeros carried)";
}

pub relation aeeh_montant_servi(e: fr.pf.core::Enfant, montant: Money) kind institutional {
    key(e);
    label fr official "montant servi arrondi au centime (annexe DSS/2B/2026/46 : montants arrondis au centième d’euro le plus proche)";
    label en unofficial "served amount rounded to the centime (DSS/2B/2026/46 annex: amounts rounded to the nearest cent)";
}

// --- R. 541-1..10 actors (finish wave) ------------------------------------

pub entity Commission {
    label fr official "commission des droits et de l'autonomie des personnes handicapées (L. 146-9 CASF)";
    label en unofficial "commission for the rights and autonomy of disabled persons (L. 146-9 CASF)";
}

pub entity MDPH {
    label fr official "maison départementale des personnes handicapées compétente (R. 541-3)";
    label en unofficial "competent departmental house for disabled persons (R. 541-3)";
}

pub enum FinanceurPriseEnCharge {
    label fr official "financeur de la prise en charge au sens de R. 541-1 al. 4";
    label en unofficial "care funder under R. 541-1 para. 4";
    ASSURANCE_MALADIE,
    ETAT,
    AIDE_SOCIALE
}

// --- R. 541-1: thresholds, tranche, prise en charge (05-seuils-taux) ------

pub relation taux_incapacite_retenu(e: fr.pf.core::Enfant, taux: Decimal) kind empirical {
    key(e);
    label fr official "taux d'incapacité permanente fixé par la commission, en points (R. 541-1 — fait établi)";
    label en unofficial "commission-fixed permanent incapacity rate, in points (R. 541-1 - established fact)";
}

pub relation seuil_80_atteint(e: fr.pf.core::Enfant) kind institutional {
    key(e);
    label fr official "taux au moins égal à 80 % (R. 541-1 al. 1)";
    label en unofficial "rate at least 80% (R. 541-1 para. 1)";
}

pub relation seuil_50_atteint(e: fr.pf.core::Enfant) kind institutional {
    key(e);
    label fr official "taux au moins égal à 50 % (R. 541-1 al. 3)";
    label en unofficial "rate at least 50% (R. 541-1 para. 3)";
}

pub relation tranche_50_80(e: fr.pf.core::Enfant) kind institutional {
    key(e);
    label fr official "taux au moins égal à 50 % et inférieur à 80 % (R. 541-1 al. 3, R. 541-4 II)";
    label en unofficial "rate at least 50% and below 80% (R. 541-1 para. 3, R. 541-4 II)";
}

pub relation service_soins_domicile(e: fr.pf.core::Enfant) kind empirical {
    label fr official "prise en charge par un service L. 312-1 CASF ou soins à domicile au sens de L. 541-1 (R. 541-1 al. 4)";
    label en unofficial "care by a L. 312-1 CASF service or home care under L. 541-1 (R. 541-1 para. 4)";
}

pub relation prise_en_charge_par(e: fr.pf.core::Enfant, f: FinanceurPriseEnCharge) kind empirical {
    key(e);
    label fr official "prise en charge accordée au titre de l'assurance maladie, de l'Etat ou de l'aide sociale (R. 541-1 al. 4)";
    label en unofficial "care granted under health insurance, the State or social aid (R. 541-1 para. 4)";
